    gas_basis_measured_by_year: { cell: "U", ev: "SOCO-55 (2026-09-20) mechanical registration of a NEW ScenarioConfig field (rule 28(c) [R-MECH-MATRIX] duty c) — U: UNTESTED, NO VERDICT MINTED HERE. The field is default-off and GAS_BASIS_DIFFERENTIAL_MEASURED_BY_YEAR carries a SOCO row and nothing else, so this ISO is inert by construction AND by measurement (resolve_annual_gas_price is identical armed and unarmed for every peer ISO, and the field is registered in _CACHE_KEY_OPTIONAL_FIELDS at False so no pre-existing key moves). Rules 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE] / 28(d): SOCO's verdict fills NO other cell — a lane wanting this here derives its OWN per-year basis from its OWN EIA-923 receipts. THE ONE-LINE TEST for whether this ISO needs it: does its keeper price gas off the scalar GAS_BASIS_DIFFERENTIAL (i.e. is gas_plant_monthly_fuel_pricing FALSE)? If yes, every one of its backcast years is carrying one year's measured basis. Evidence: docs/handoffs/PRECOMMIT-soco-55-2026-09-20.md." },
