    mustrun_chp_btm_holdout: { cell: "U", ev: "miso-253 (2026-09-10): row minted with the field (rule 28 duty (c)). UNTESTED HERE. The injection is ISO-GENERIC -- _must_run_profiles runs for every ISO -- so this is a REAL cell, not n/a, and the measured footprint is nonzero: 2023 0.807 / 2024 0.845 / 2025 0.823 TWh of chp=Y biomass (26.8 / 28.5 / 67.8 %). Rule 25 [R-ISO-SCOPE]: MISO's charter and its EIA-930 OTH corroboration transfer to NOBODY; this ISO's cell opens only on its own market's evidence, and the OTH comparator in particular does NOT generalise -- measured across all seven ISOs the model-vs-OTH ratio ranges from 0.55 (PJM 2025, model BELOW telemetry) to NEGATIVE OTH in CAISO (a known 930 artifact), so an ISO adopting this must establish its own grid-side authority first. Default off, byte-identical off; this ISO's keeper is unchanged and unaffected." },
