    hydro_ror_split: { cell: "K", ev: "O -> K 2026-09-23 (hydro-5): PROMOTED on the owner ruling; keeper 2026-09-22-hydro-5-neiso-ror. U -> O 2026-09-22 (hydro-5): TESTED BY SOLVE ON ALL SIX YEARS 2020-2025, one shard per year (rule 36), vs keeper neiso112 (form 4, G-DRIFT all INERT). RECOMMENDED FOR PROMOTION, owner ruling OPEN (rule 31). Classifier reviewed on ISNE's own labelled subset: 77/125 plants, 66.1 % of labelled MW — admitted because the misses are one-sided (317.9 MW of labelled RoR called shapeable vs 68.0 MW the other way; completion-RoR precision 81.8 %), so the flat treatment is UNDER-applied. Clean-year falsification (2025): shapeable 1,118 MW vs measured mean-diurnal swing 221 MW; RoR base <= measured p01 in 11/12 months (June 384 vs 360 MW, disclosed). RoR class ~48 % of energy. MEASURED: hours at 0 MW 0-1,908 -> 0; p05 0 -> 78-446 MW; top-dec 0.165-0.303 -> 0.141-0.216 (2025 clean measured 0.120); daily CV 0.484-0.866 -> 0.289-0.493 (2025 measured 0.167); annual hydro <= 0.0001 %. G4: 0 PASS->FAIL flips; C3a moves away in 4 of 6 years (largest 2021 +2.48 -> +3.58 $/MWh), all still PASS. hydro_min_flow_floor NOT tested: NG:WAT folds PS before 2025. Record: docs/RESULT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md; PRECOMMIT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md" },
